        "created_at": "2025-07-06T10:36:57.514Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There is no terminal specified. You may use any terminal of your choice, as long as it is <strong>NOT</strong> <strong>integrated with any AI features or auto-suggestions</strong>. Warp has AI integrated in it and it’s a GUI app. Personally, I would not recommend using GUI tools during the learning phase as it defeats the purpose of gaining hands-on experience with CLI.</p>",
